deo/enhance models with credit costs |\n| `SystemPrompt` | Style prompts (cinematic, anime, etc.) |\n| `Creation` | Generated images/videos with status |\n| `Revision` | Variations of creations (costs credits) |\n| `Enhancement` | Upscale, denoise, restore (costs credits) |\n| `CreditTransaction` | All credit changes (audit trail) |\n| `GlobalConfig` | App settings (signup credits, limits, etc.) |\n\n---\n\n## 🌐 API Endpoints\n\n### Authentication\n| Method | Endpoint | Description |\n|--------|----------|-------------|\n| `POST` | `/api/auth/send-otp` | Send 6-digit code to email |\n| `POST` | `/api/auth/verify-otp` | Verify code, create user, return JWT |\n\n### User & Credits\n| Method | Endpoint | Description |\n|--------|----------|-------------|\n| `GET` | `/api/me` | Current user profile |\n| `GET` | `/api/credits` | Balance + last 50 transactions |\n\n### Generation\n| Method | Endpoint | Description |\n|--------|----------|-------------|\n| `GET` | `/api/models?type=image` | Available models with credit costs |\n| `GET` | `/api/prompts?type=video` | System style prompts |\n| `POST` | `/api/creations` | Generate image/video (checks credits) |\n| `GET` | `/api/creations` | List user's creations (paginated) |\n| `GET` | `/api/creations/:id` | Creation details + revisions + enhancements |\n| `POST` | `/api/creations/:id/revision` | Create variation (costs credits) |\n| `POST` | `/api/creations/:id/enhance` | Upscale/denoise/etc (costs credits) |\n\n### Admin (requires `ADMIN_EMAILS` env)\n| Method | Endpoint | Description |\n|--------|----------|-------------|\n| `POST` | `/api/admin/models` | Add new model config |\n| `GET` | `/api/admin/models` | List all models |\n| `POST` | `/api/admin/prompts` | Add new system prompt |\n| `GET` | `/api/admin/prompts` | List all prompts |\n| `POST` | `/api/admin/credits` | Top-up user credits |\n\n---\n\n## 🔐 Key Features Implemented\n\n1. **Credit Enforcement** — Every creation/revision/enhancement checks credits before proceeding\n2. **Automatic Refunds** — Credits refunded on generation failures\n3. **Background Processing** — Inference API calls run async, creation status updates via polling\n4. **System Prompts** — Prepend style prompts to user prompts (cinematic, anime, etc.)\n5. **Credit Audit Trail** — Every transaction recorded with `CreditTransaction`\n6. **Admin Endpoints** — Protected by `ADMIN_EMAILS` env variable\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Next Steps to Run\n\n### 1. Set up environment variables\n```bash\ncd /home/sameer/hash-shit/8x/app\n# Edit .env with your real values:\n# DATABASE_URL (from Neon), JWT_SECRET, SMTP credentials, etc.\n```\n\n### 2. Push schema to Neon DB\n```bash\nnpx prisma db push\n```\n\n### 3. Seed default data\n```bash\nnpx prisma db seed\n# or\nnpx tsx prisma/seed.ts\n```\n\n### 4. Start the app\n```bash\nnpm run dev\n# Backend API available at http://localhost:3000/api/*\n```\n\n---\n\n## 💡 Suggested Additional Features\n\n| Feature | Why It Helps |\n|---------|-------------|\n| **Webhooks / SSE** | Real-time generation progress updates |\n| **Rate Limiting** | Prevent abuse per IP/email |\n| **Credit Purchases** | Stripe/PayPal integration for buying credits |\n| **Gallery/Explore** | Public feed of top creations (social feature) |\n| **Folders/Collections** | Let users organize creations |\n| **Batch Generation** | Generate multiple variations at once |\n| **Prompt History** | Save and reuse past prompts |\n| **Image-to-Image** | Upload reference image for style transfer |\n| **Lora/Checkpoint Models** | Custom fine-tuned model support |\n| **NSFW Filtering** | Automatic content moderation |\n| **Analytics Dashboard** | Admin: popular models, credit usage, active users |\n\n---\n\nThe backend is ready. When you want to start the frontend, just say the word! 🎨","background_tasks":[],"session_crons":[]}

